title ALES172 — Lotus's stereo_band: the band-pass carried into stereo, the SAME two cutoffs on BOTH channels, each channel carrying its OWN cascade state — the third rung of the stereo EQ / filter class
prompt Autonomous loop lap after ALES171: take the next agent-doable crux Lindy-first crux-first, self-approve the design round, send each finished increment to origin and xykj61 as its own signed round, STOP at custody gates.
think ALES170 opened the stereo EQ / filter class with the one-pole tone control (one edge kept) and ALES171 followed with the two-band shelf (both bands tilted by gain). The gesture that ISOLATES a range on a master — the telephone voice, the drum bus carved to its body, the wah's throat — is the band-pass. Its mono form (band.rye, ALES46) already stands as a Bandpass struct: a high-pass at the low cutoff cascaded into a low-pass at the high cutoff, each stage carrying its own state. The natural third rung of the class.
think Unlike ALES171's stateless shelf and like ALES170's tone, a band-pass carries running estimates, so composed the stereo form as a StereoBandpass struct holding two mono Bandpass (left, right), both built with the SAME four coefficients via init, each keeping its OWN cascade state — mirroring band.rye's own struct API (run + reset) rather than the free-function carry API. Linking state across channels would bleed one channel's transients into the other's band, a bug exactly as for the tone control.
think Atomicity: StereoBandpass.run precheck BOTH cutoff pairs and the span ONCE against the shared length up front (tone.precheck), before either channel writes, so a refusal never band-passes one channel and leaves the other torn and no legal low cutoff advances a state before an illegal high cutoff refuses. StereoBandError = tone.ToneError reused whole. Asserted both inner band-passes carry the same two cutoffs so the shared knobs hold the image.
think Proved four laws against the real ALES46 tool: stereo band-pass law (each channel == mono Bandpass.run with the same two cutoffs byte for byte, channels genuinely differing); carry law (a span band-passed in two pieces, each channel carrying its own state, == the whole once on both — all four i64 states surviving the seam); image law (identical-channel master stays identical, a settled constant rejected to zero per channel as the high-pass drops DC); reset/balance/silence/atomicity/degenerate (reset clearing all four states and re-opening both transients, three refusals each leaving both channels and all four states untouched and balanced).
obs No custody gate reached — pure local i16 DSP siloed to lotus/, a self-approved design round. Built and ran on metal; witness GREEN through Rishi, TAME clean (opening triad, ≥2 asserts/fn with // invariant, no @memcpy, named errors with try, four i64 states at full precision). Third EQ rung landed; the stereo EQ class now has its tone control, its shelf, and its band-pass.
loom witness=ales_stereo_band_witness selftest=GREEN laws=4 channels=2 states=4 class=eq-filter-rung-3
