file tools/ales_stereo_band_witness.rish the witness proving it GREEN on metal
recommend keep-going the stereo EQ class has its tone control, shelf, and band-pass; the next Lindy rungs are the band-reject / notch (ALES47) and the parametric bell (ALES48) carried into stereo — continue the EQ family
